# Earthrumbler is symmetric: "from your graveyard" is the activating player's own. Bot1 casts and sacrifices Black Lotus on turn 1 (an
# artifact card in Bot1's graveyard) and nothing else. Bot2 casts its Earthrumbler on turn 2 with its own Black Lotus, a Mox Emerald and a
# Mox Jet, and exiles that Lotus from its own graveyard to animate it (Bot1's Lotus, also an artifact card, stays where it is). It is a 7/6
# artifact creature with vigilance and trample for the turn, and no creature again on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Earthrumbler
Island x16

